	<h2>Why Choose Me?</h2>
	
	<p>
		I manage a team of cybersecurity professionals, teach students at York University, mentor newcomers
		to Canada (and cybersecurity), work as a <a href="https://www.giac.org/certified-professional/santosh-ganjur-somasekhara/189434" target="_blank">SANS GIAC Advisor</a>, 
