		including incident management, infrastructure support, and customer success.
	</p>

	<p>
		I'm an engineer by education but began my career working various roles in IT service, infrastructure
		and delivery, and customer success – from handling client escalations and managing incident
		response, to leading an incredibly capable team of individuals in successfully handling IT
		migrations for over 5 years. I am committed to ensuring customer success.
